tlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"uYUsK2muRiy0ahFZchlVEw","review_id":"E2pPkTMDYldDYQaWPk1D7g","date":"2018-03-13T18:18:16","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9351776838302612,"text_excerpt":"Awesome gin fizz. Really a neat place with lots of history. Live band the night we went. Very laid back with excellent cocktails. One of the few places near bourbon street with actual craft cocktails. Cocktails were delicious, but expect to pay."},{"business_id":"uYUsK2muRiy0ahFZchlVEw","review_id":"DV7nrmDxJJBwVuwfVwF4jA","date":"2018-08-26T14:33:21","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9339560270309448,"text_excerpt":"Went down after dinner for a quick drink and found a loud and raucous jazz group on stage. Loved it. We grabbed a whiskey on the rocks from the extensive whiskey menu and found a comfy couch and settled in for a while. Prices are typical for NOLA and all the usuals are on the menu. The whiskey menu has over 75 makers. Even if you don't stay at the Bourbon Orleans Hotel try out the bar. The bar keeps are friendly and the music is always good."},{"business_id":"uYUsK2muRiy0ahFZchlVEw","review_id":"tvgpf4CPFeZW4kB05TjBTw","date":"2015-06-13T21:40:50","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9279310703277588,"text_excerpt":"My wife and I had this highlighted to try so we stopped in around 9:30 pm on Friday. This was a really nice lounge with great atmosphere. It really captures the classic side of New Orleans in its vibe and decor. Our bartender was Becca and she was both pleasant and knowledgeable. She recommended a Chardonnay for me to try that was on point and I also tried the Trinity Oaks Pinot Grigio which I enjoyed. My wife ordered the Midas Cup which was their most publicized drink and she said it did not disappoint. She also tried a Bloody Mary but didn't enjoy that as much. A Bloody Mary is an acquired taste that varies from person to person so I think it was more that she likes a slightly saltier v..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"uYUsK2muRiy0ahFZchlVEw","photo_id":"iGShy32xEAqZ4EsNY1-hMA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/iGShy32xEAqZ4EsNY1-hMA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9239150881767273},{"business_id":"uYUsK2muRiy0ahFZchlVEw","photo_id":"0glvSD6FIYmoYbycrxSe1A","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/0glvSD6FIYmoYbycrxSe1A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9116100072860718},{"business_id":"uYUsK2muRiy0ahFZchlVEw","photo_id":"HPO3fBKmIe4NnomJ9J_Skw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/HPO3fBKmIe4NnomJ9J_Skw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8936697244644165},{"business_id":"uYUsK2muRiy0ahFZchlVEw","photo_id":"ybKbzn4Us9UxBATfIbUb2Q","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/ybKbzn4Us9UxBATfIbUb2Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8679668307304382},{"business_id":"uYUsK2muRiy0ahFZchlVEw","photo_id":"Qn4ZvMfhvs-CKARNiuh89g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Qn4ZvMfhvs-CKARNiuh89g.jpg","visual_representativ